<title>USA: Missouri lean hog carcass values - Dec 4.</title>
<headline>Missouri lean hog carcass values - Dec 4.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY, MO 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Plant delivered prices on lean slaughter hogs were steady with Tuesday's close. -USDA</p>
<p>Price range (dollars/cwt) -</p>
<p>-- 49-50 percent lean, carcass weight of 178-198 lbs</p>
<p>	 80.25-83.10</p>
<p>-- 50-52 percent lean with a carcass weight of 178-202 lbs</p>
<p>	 81.50-85.63</p>
<p>Estimated Receipts: 1,650</p>
<p>Note: Producer reported prices with grade premiums or discounts included.</p>
<p>Source: Missouri Department of Agriculture-USDA Livestock Market News</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
</text>
